# Load sizing for the HNSW variant of the multi-tenant RAG profile. With 50 mutations/s it
# sustains about 92 q/s, and the host is full at about 153 q/s without mutations. The top stage
# and the sampler use about one half of 92 q/s. Query settings do not change the table, so the
# reopen step uses this file too.
-Dquery.rate.values=20,40
